# =============================================================================
# Bright OS Lite Edition — Additional packages
# Target: Older/low-spec hardware (2-4 GB RAM, single-core/dual-core CPUs)
# Desktop: LXQt + Openbox + Picom (replaces full KDE Plasma desktop stack)
# Key principle: no Plasma desktop packages, no LibreOffice, no heavy IDEs
# =============================================================================

# --- Web browser ---
firefox-esr

# --- Media (lightweight) ---
mpv
viewnior
gpicview

# --- Office (lightweight alternatives to LibreOffice) ---
abiword
gnumeric

# --- System utilities ---
lximage-qt
screengrab
qps
galculator
transmission-cli
mtpaint
xarchiver

# --- Lightweight terminal is provided by qterminal (in desktop-lite) ---
# --- File manager provided by pcmanfm-qt (in desktop-lite) ---
